{
  "statement": "As the SafetyAgent, I emphasize the importance of Safety & Reliability in our ATM system. SAF-01 ensures no account can have a negative balance, which is fundamental for user trust. SAF-02 guarantees that funds can be automatically withdrawn from the saving account if needed, enhancing reliability. SAF-03 mandates clear user notifications for insufficient funds, preventing unexpected errors. SAF-04 ensures comprehensive transaction logging for accountability. SAF-05 focuses on secure PIN verification, safeguarding user access. SAF-06 allows for safe degradation during maintenance, balancing operational needs. Finally, SAF-07 provides users with a summary of account status post-transaction to reinforce system reliability.",
